WEBVTT

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:10.270
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:20.040
Rental Magica

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:28.120
The shadow of the moon as it waxes and wanes...
Michikakeru tsuki no kage sotto

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:37.800
...gently stirs the beat of sorrow in your heart.
kanashimi no kodou furuwasu

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.490
Its wandering attraction...
Samayou inryoku

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:47.430
...reflected in your eyes.
hitomi ni utsushite

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:53.420
You will surpass the darkness of Ioneliness.
Kodoku no yami wo koeteyuku

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:59.120
You know that truth in your heart.
Shinjitsu wa kono mune ni

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:04.790
That gentleness will become your strength.
Yasashisa wa tsuyosa ni naru

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:09.430
Don't be afraid. Believe.
Osorenaide shinjiru koto

00:01:09.430 --> 00:01:14.270
The brilliance that blooms in the cosmos eternally...
Sora ni saku kirameki wa towa ni

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:19.240
...embraces the voice of time.
toki no koe dakishime

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:24.310
Play your dream for me.
Kanadete yume

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:29.050
Let me hear.
Kikasete

00:01:29.550 --> 00:01:33.780
Wind, speak to me.
Kaze tsutaete

00:01:34.220 --> 00:01:40.290
Tell me what courage is.
Yuuki wo

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.480
Are... Are you all right?

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:12.890
Yes.

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:15.590
The ceremony failed, didn't it?

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:17.630
I swear...

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:20.630
I swear, we'll get it back!

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:24.330
In the name of Goetia!

00:02:28.810 --> 00:02:31.750
Episode 17
DEMON REBELLION

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:38.640
Heki-ken!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:39.210
Hai!

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:40.880
San-ken!

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:41.520
Hai!

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:43.380
Hou-ken!

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:43.980
Hai!

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:49.990
Not bad.

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:56.700
Daphne!

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:01.510
I beg your pardon for disturbing
your training, Master Itsuki.

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:05.910
Master Itsuki, have you seen Miss Adelicia?

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:09.040
Adelicia? Isn't she in England now?

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:12.410
So, she hasn't been here, either...

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:14.810
Has something happened to Adelicia?

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.050
No, it's nothing to concern yourself with.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.590
Please forget it.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:21.460
Again, I beg your pardon, but I'm in a hurry,

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:23.590
so I'm afraid I must go now.

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:33.300
Sekiren, excuse me, but I have to!

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:34.170
Right.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:42.580
Daphne!

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:54.260
Mage Recruiting Agency
ASTRAL
We rent mages to meet your demands.

00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:56.130
Mage Recruiting Agency
ASTRAL
We rent mages to meet your demands.
Huh? Adelicia just?

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:56.530
Mage Recruiting Agency
ASTRAL
We rent mages to meet your demands.

00:03:56.530 --> 00:03:57.000
Mage Recruiting Agency
ASTRAL
We rent mages to meet your demands.
Yeah, she just phoned.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:59.260
Yeah, she just phoned.

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:01.600
And it was actually her?

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:05.870
Yeah. She said she'd be delayed coming
back and for us not to worry about her.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:11.270
Was there anything else?
Didn't she say anything for me?

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:13.910
What were you expecting her to say, Boss?

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:18.720
Unfortunately, it wasn't a
love call or anything like that.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:21.310
Wha?! No, that's not what I meant!

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:42.170
What... is this?

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.120
Forneus!

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.770
Who the hell are you?

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:15.900
This guy's controlling Forneus...

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:17.410
Where's Adelicia?!

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:20.650
What's?

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:22.950
You...

00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:26.990
What... have you done here?

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:32.160
You stand on the brink of death,
yet ask such a tedious question.

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:35.950
Bridges connect this world with the other.

00:05:40.470 --> 00:05:41.400
Forneus!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.780
I don't know if you're a servant
or a familiar of the girl,

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:54.480
but would you care to see how long
you can live while being eaten?

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:56.440
The girl?

00:05:56.580 --> 00:05:57.310
Itsuki!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.220
Clive Roland, release Itsuki at once!

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:10.220
I haven't seen you since I lost
my left arm, Miss Adelicia!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:12.130
What are you doing here?

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:13.630
A foolish question.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:16.100
Asmoday is the demon with
dominion over the Orient.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:19.110
From the position of the ley lines and stars,

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:20.400
there are only a few places from
which you can summon her.

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:22.140
I see.

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:26.310
Then, as a reward for your answer,
I shall release your servant.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:31.950
Itsuki!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:34.980
Why are you trying to summon Asmoday?!

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:38.790
I have no objections to your inheriting Goetia.

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:42.060
However, as a student of Oswald Lenn Mathers,

00:06:42.060 --> 00:06:46.000
is it not reasonable that I, too,
inherit a part of his legacy?

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:50.260
Father hated that about you!

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:53.140
That's why you were cast out!

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:56.540
Surely the princess of Solomon would not use...

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:59.710
...a magical weapon for so boorish a task as this.

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:03.480
Your father would be disappointed
if he could see this.

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:08.020
Although he had a rather messy
end of his own, didn't he?

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:08.950
Hold your tongue!

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:10.090
Adelicia!

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.570
So, how does it feel?

00:07:22.570 --> 00:07:25.770
To taste the fangs of your own demon!

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:30.610
The Magi Night isn't over yet,

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.110
but this amount of spell power will do nicely.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:35.840
Let us close the curtain for now.

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:45.950
Adelicia...

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:54.930
Itsuki, what are you doing here?

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:56.830
Um, well...

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:59.700
Daphne came looking for you
and I was concerned, so...

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:00.940
For heaven's sake.

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:04.210
Didn't I specifically call Astral about this?

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:08.410
Yeah, but I figured you'd
gotten wrapped up in something.

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:12.820
That you were trying to
fight a battle alone again...

00:08:13.450 --> 00:08:15.420
Look, just stay out of it!

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.220
Honestly...

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:29.240
I should just expect that someone like you...

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:32.600
...would do something like this, shouldn't I?

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:35.300
Um, uh... Look...

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:49.280
The truth is, I went to England
to formally succeed my father.

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:51.860
We made careful preparations...

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:56.760
...and had begun the ceremony to
summon a very special demon.

00:08:57.000 --> 00:08:58.360
A special demon?

00:08:58.770 --> 00:09:03.970
Forneus... Marbas... Eligor...
Botis... Glasya-Labolas...

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:08.570
Above these 72 demons
stand four special ones.

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:11.370
The greatest ones, ruled over by King Solomon.

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:14.050
One of them is Asmoday.

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:16.580
What?! A demon even greater than Forneus?!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.050
But we never expected that man to
show up at the site of the ceremony...

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:21.420
In the name of the creator of all things,
But we never expected that man to
show up at the site of the ceremony...

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:23.460
In the name of the creator of all things,

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:26.520
I command thee to appear before
me and swear thy allegiance!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:30.750
Appear in this circle without delay!

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:33.300
Obey the power I possess!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.060
Obey my word without question!

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:38.310
We had no way to shunt the spell power
gathered there for the summoning,

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:39.570
and it went wild.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.540
Many of our disciples were killed.

00:09:45.250 --> 00:09:49.770
Because of that, my contract with
Asmoday is temporarily canceled now.

00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:53.880
I canceled a contract with
one of the four demons.

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:56.150
So, that's why even Forneus won't?

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:59.660
That makes what you're
doing even more reckless!

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.360
You can't take that guy on alone!

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:03.930
As long as I suffer this disgrace,

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:07.460
I cannot ask the help of any
magical association or mage!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:11.370
That's the final straw for a
mage who has lost their magic!

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:18.180
If Clive tries to cast the summoning tonight,

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:21.340
then the stars and ley lines
leave only one place he can do it.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:24.210
Go back to Astral, Itsuki.

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:25.540
No.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:26.410
Itsuki!

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:30.390
You won't waver from
anything you said, will you?

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:31.550
Of course not.

00:10:31.890 --> 00:10:33.590
Then what about a non-mage?

00:10:34.560 --> 00:10:37.160
You said you wouldn't accept
help from another mage, right?

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:42.900
Then, regular non-mage Itsuki Iba
is fine to stay with you, right?!

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.840
Regular Itsuki?

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:47.940
Whether you're a mage or a regular girl,

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:49.840
you're still you, right, Adelicia?

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:51.210
Itsuki...

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:55.680
Then, as regular Itsuki, I'm staying with you!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:04.520
Do you even realize what you're saying?

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.030
No fair...

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:18.860
Asmoday, demon who rules the Orient.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:21.730
Beauty that makes one forget terror.

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:24.500
Failure will mean death.

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:28.610
This time, no matter what!

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:32.750
If he can summon Asmoday and control her,

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:36.150
Clive's bloodline will get recognition
from The Association.

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:38.360
He must want to prove that.

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:39.850
I see.

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:43.320
Anyway, what sort of demon is Asmoday?

00:11:44.370 --> 00:11:46.830
She possesses a form and
face of ultimate beauty...

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.530
...as well as the greatest power of a demon.

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:54.770
You have to pay a high cost just to summon her.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:58.780
And if the one who summons
her isn't skillful enough,

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:01.610
the price they pay can be tragic.

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:03.240
Meaning...

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:07.050
Clive tried to summon
Asmoday before and failed.

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:09.380
He paid for it then with his arm.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:11.620
The price...

00:12:12.360 --> 00:12:16.130
But what am I going to offer?

00:12:20.870 --> 00:12:22.030
Let's go, Itsuki.

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:23.430
R-Right!

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:39.850
Itsuki, keep that talisman
I gave you on you at all times.

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:40.710
Right.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:52.730
Begone!

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:58.310
In the name of the successors of Solomon and
the powers which summon you to this world,

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:00.430
I command you! Begone!

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:03.540
In the name of the lord of the
four corners of the heavens!

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:05.270
Begone!!

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:11.090
I appeal to thee and summon thee!

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:13.990
By the power of the supreme throne, I order thee!

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:16.360
In the name of the greatest and mightiest prince!

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:21.520
By the first prince of Apologia in
the nine legions, I summon thee!

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:24.150
He's forcing the whole configuration.

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:27.060
This can hardly be called Solomonic magic.

00:13:27.670 --> 00:13:32.910
From the very start, Asmoday was more
demon than Clive could ever handle.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:33.640
Right.

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:34.710
Forneus!

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:50.520
He's actually sacrificing a
demon for another demon?!

00:13:50.790 --> 00:13:53.690
By the power of the most supreme lord,

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:56.290
I command thee!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:14:01.800
By all the power in this world and the
might of the kingdom wrapped in glory,

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:03.670
I command thee, come!

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:05.640
Stop it...

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:07.440
Stop it!

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:10.640
I shall surpass you, Princess of Solomon!

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:13.080
Come forth, Asmoday!

00:14:13.150 --> 00:14:17.170
Supreme queen, ruler of the
72 corps and the 18 cacodemons!

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:22.450
The talisman is crumbling!

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:23.820
Can it be?

00:14:24.690 --> 00:14:25.660
No!

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:07.830
Asmoday!

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.830
She's filled with rage.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:33.990
It's no wonder!

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:37.890
After bringing so many of his own
magical concepts into the summoning!

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:43.170
Begone! Begone! Begone!

00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:17.530
Itsuki!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:19.770
Are you trying to kill yourself, Itsuki?!

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:21.040
I won't allow that.

00:16:21.110 --> 00:16:23.630
I won't allow that! Not ever!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:27.940
Begone!

00:16:28.150 --> 00:16:30.950
In the name of the supreme
lord of all, I bid thee depart!

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.150
If thou does not, the skies shall quake,

00:16:33.150 --> 00:16:36.060
the seas shall boil, and flames
shall lose their heat!

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:40.820
The earth shall tremble, the four powers shall
run wild and bind thee in eternal imprisonment!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:44.860
In the name of almighty God and the
guardians of His throne in every direction!

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.170
I want power!

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:51.440
The true power light grants to a mage!

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:55.940
For that, I will pay any price!

00:16:56.980 --> 00:16:59.540
Look! Look! Look!

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:01.470
No!

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.440
I mustn't let it control me!

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:08.150
Work with the eye, Young Master.

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:11.160
Don't let it control you.

00:17:11.230 --> 00:17:12.820
Fight together with it.

00:17:13.530 --> 00:17:16.360
Fight together... with my right eye!

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:19.490
Oh, Queen, begone!!

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:28.880
A thread...

00:17:28.880 --> 00:17:29.870
Itsuki?

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:35.610
There's some sort of thread connecting
my left hand with that demon's right hand.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.310
Thread?

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.550
He has a path to Asmoday!

00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:43.890
In that case!

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:46.520
Itsuki?

00:17:47.530 --> 00:17:49.260
Forgive me for what I'm about to do.

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:50.590
Huh?

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.230
Wh-wh-wh-what was?!

00:18:01.310 --> 00:18:02.800
Don't misunderstand!

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:05.870
I was just using you to get
through to the path, Itsuki.

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:08.040
Path? Oh...

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:11.090
By passing my blood into you,

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:14.080
I've temporarily established
an infectious magic link.

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.710
K-Kissing is a type of ceremony!

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:19.420
Right! So, now what?

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:23.900
I'm going to renew my contract with Asmoday!

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.830
Now that the path is directly linking us,

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:28.270
I can establish the contract if
we get into that magic circle!

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:28.890
Gotcha!

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:44.610
Five Elements Fist!

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:48.220
Wood! Fire! Earth! Gold! Water!

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:49.290
Itsuki!

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:51.560
The Five Elements Fist...

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:54.120
What has that crazy monk been teaching you?

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:57.330
Itsuki's been more and more easily affected by...

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:59.420
...spell power since he accepted that eye.

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:03.070
That's why it was so easy for him
to form a path with Asmoday.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.460
But, because of that...

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:07.330
I command thee!

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:10.840
In my own name as a descendant of
Solomon and that of the supreme lord,

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:12.210
I command thee!

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:16.880
If I can add my spell power to Itsuki...

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:21.120
...as he's joined with Asmoday,
Itsuki and I will become one!

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:27.090
Now! Oh, Asmodai!

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:32.130
Supreme queen, ruler of the
72 corps and the 18 cacodemons!

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:35.370
Return now to thy rightful throne!

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:37.160
Obey my commands!

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:48.440
I swore I'd pay any price!

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:50.420
Adelicia!

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:52.110
I give...

00:19:52.550 --> 00:19:54.850
I give to you my own future!

00:19:55.060 --> 00:19:56.920
Now obey!!

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:29.490
Asmoday...

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:32.550
Do you understand what I said?

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:42.930
Wow.

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:44.930
Now depart.

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:50.140
Now that thou hast answered my
request sincerely, I bid thee depart.

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:52.840
Withdraw in tranquility and silence.

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:11.460
Thank you... Itsuki.

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:16.830
Tell me, Adelicia, what you said before...

00:21:17.370 --> 00:21:18.900
About giving her your future?

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:27.970
It was all that I had to offer
a demon like Asmoday.

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:38.250
I promised them that every instant of the
rest of my life will be devoted to magic.

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:41.690
That's!

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:07.850
Over and over, holding my wounded hand...
Kizutsuku te wo nandomo tsunaide

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:16.250
...you walk this uncertain path with me...
fuan bakari no kono michi wo aruite

00:22:17.530 --> 00:22:29.310
...amidst the days as they slowly drift by.
yukkuri nagareta hibi no naka de bokura ga

00:22:29.580 --> 00:22:41.220
The things we obtain are so warm, so beloved.
Te ni shita mono wa konna ni atatakute itoshinda

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:47.490
Please, as time goes by, let's keep right on...
Nee konomama toki no naka

00:22:47.560 --> 00:22:52.000
...laughing and walking together.
waratte aruite yukou

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:56.270
It's because you're with me...
Kimi ga iru kara

00:22:56.270 --> 00:23:01.370
...that I can keep moving forward.
mae ni susumerunda

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:13.240
Now our feelings are becoming one...
Ima bokura no omoi ga hitotsu ni natte

00:23:13.620 --> 00:23:17.290
...and showing the path to us.
michi wo shimesunda

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:21.560
So please, keep on holding my hand...
Dakara kono te zutto

00:23:21.560 --> 00:23:24.620
...and never let it go...
hanasanaide

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:27.100
Society [KESSHA]

00:23:27.100 --> 00:23:29.130
Society [KESSHA]
That refers to things like Astral and Goetia.

00:23:29.200 --> 00:23:30.370
There's also The Association...

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:32.510
Crap, I need to file that report with them!

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:36.010
The Association's a bunch of bureaucrats,
so if you're late, they get real testy!

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:37.140
Right, I'll be careful with that.

00:23:37.140 --> 00:23:39.250
Is there anything you've forgotten, Prof. Miwa?

